    "title": "Police investigate bullets found at Parkland High School - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Pamela Sroka-Holzmann ,\n12 hours ago South Whitehall police are investigating how two bullets ended up this month in separate incidents on the property of Parkland High School. The initial incident was at 6:15 a.m. March 5 when a Parkland High School staff member found a bullet in the school’s parking lot at 2700 N. Cedar Crest Blvd., district officials said. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 4",
